
~ start

if GameState.door_fallen
	The door has fallen down, trapping the chair part that saved your life under it.
	PLUM: ... (sad)
	VINCENT: Awe... come on... I'll get you another chair part. (sad)
	=> END

else
	match interaction_count
		when 1
			PLUM: It's a door! (happy)
			VINCENT: It's a fake door. (serious)
			PLUM: I was getting there. (angry)
			You try to pull the door.
			It's losened quite a bit. Shaking it one more time might cause it to drop.
			VINCENT: Stop wasting time. (serious)
			$> set_node_skew("Sprite2D", -12.7)
			=> END

		else
			if GameState.has_fixed_chair_part
				The door almost crushes you.
				Luckily enough, the chair part saved your life.
				PLUM: I was so lucky (scared)
				$> GameState.use_fixed_chair_part_for_door()
				$> hide_node("Sprite2D")
				$> disable_collision("CollisionShape2D")
				$> enable_collision("CollisionShape2D2")
				$> show_node("Sprite2D2")
				Seems like the door was hiding a code behind it.
				'247'
				$> GameState.collect_safe_code()
				Code was added to your items.
				=> END

			else
				You pull the door even harder, using all the strenght in your 10 year old body.
				PLUM: Oh! (suprised)
				(The door squshes her)
				[scene=game_over]
				=> END
